A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the fighting game known as '''Fight Club''' (ファイトクラブ, '' Faito Kurabu'', '''Fight Club''') was held from April 16th, 2018 to April 25th, 2018.<br>
The game is published by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]].

As of November 30th, 2018, the game has been discontinued and can no longer be downloaded.

